{
  "title": "one quality state per record, every work state, and the cohort a parent's leaves make",
  "covers": [
    "exact, timing-floor, approximate (sparse), missing (no_worker_attempt) and reconstructed each read as one state with the reasons that produced it, on the writer, the tail and a hydrated device",
    "a reconstructed record that is also sparse keeps reconstructed (the higher precedence) and lists sparse among its reasons",
    "each attempt's effortSeconds and state match the issue it is the only attempt of",
    "a cancelled issue owes no work and has no work state; a hydrated device's wall is missing with replay_unavailable",
    "a parent is reconstructed when any child is, with partial and its children's inputs as reasons",
    "the cohort's denominator is the done leaves beneath the parent: the open and cancelled leaves are counted as not eligible, never in coverage",
    "the exact ratio aggregate is over exact records only; the admitted aggregate follows the exclusion",
    "exclude and excludeReasons drop records from the listing and the admitted aggregate, never from the counts; timing-floor stays listed unless it is excluded by name",
    "the level rule on every device: exclude approximate alone drops the reconstructed record that is sparse, and include exact,reconstructed keeps only the clean reconstructed one beside the exact one"
  ],
